y. I've re-traced the path and checked the neighbor validation logic at crucial points, specifically at (4,2). The comparison of an 8x8 grid's output confirms my logic. I've located discrepancies in the output I previously tested. My goal is to ensure the 8x8 matches perfectly with the intended spiral pattern.\n\n\n",
